        "authorName": "RckStr8",
        "name": {
          "en-US": "MLBB Limiter"
        },
        "summary": {
          "en-US": "Limits Mobile Legends to a set number of matches a day"
        },
        "description": {
          "en-US": "MLBB Limiter caps how many Mobile Legends matches you play each day. The day runs from 6 AM to 6 AM.\n\nHow it works:\n* After each match it spots the Victory / Defeat stats screen with on-device text recognition. Screenshots are only taken while the game is open, and nothing is saved or sent anywhere.\n* When you reach your limit, a lock screen covers the game after a short grace period.\n* Night curfew: a match that ends after 12:30 AM locks the game until 6 AM.\n\nOn the lock screen:\n* Play one more match: up to 3 times a day, not after 1:30 AM.\n* +1 minute: for collecting rewards or finishing events.\n* Go to home screen.\n\nAlso:\n* +1 Match button for a match the app missed.\n* Optional auto-repair that switches Accessibility back on if the phone turns it off (needs a one-time ADB command).\n* Material You design that follows your wallpaper colours.\n\nNeeds Usage access, Display over other apps, the Accessibility service (screenshots only) and unrestricted battery use.\n"
        },
